ebate_87a": 1, "tax_after_rebate": 0, "surcharge": 1, "cess": 0, "total_tax_liability": 0, "tds": 1, "net_tax_payable": 0}, "pct_errors": {"gross_salary": 0.01849796522382538, "sec_10_13a": 0.0, "sec_10_5": 0.0, "sec_16_ia": 0.0, "sec_16_ii": 0.0, "sec_16_iii": 0.0, "net_salary": 0.023557126030624265, "combined_stcg": 2.0, "combined_ltcg": 0.37542662116040953, "savings_bank_interest": 0.0, "deposit_interest": 0.0, "epf_taxable_interest": 0.0, "gross_total_income": 0.0660377358490566, "total_taxable_income": 0.09699279966116052, "80c_80ccc_80ccd1": 0.0, "80ccd_1b": 50000.0, "80ccd_2": 0.0, "80d": 0.0, "80e": 0.0, "80g": 0.2857142857142857, "80tta": 0.0, "80ttb": 0.0, "total_deductions": 0.18685121107266436, "tax_at_slab_rates": 0.0956421133821828, "tax_stcg_111a": 0.0, "tax_ltcg_112a": 0.0, "tax_ltcg_non_equity": 1.0, "total_tax_before_rebate": 0.05650739908350603, "rebate_87a": 0.0, "tax_after_rebate": 0.05650739908350603, "surcharge": 0.0, "cess": 0.05650739908350603, "total_tax_liability": 0.05650739908350603, "tds": 0.0, "net_tax_payable": 0.3275637446491718}, "total_score": 19, "latency_sec": 508.78, "prompt_tokens": 239318, "completion_tokens": 24346, "total_tokens": 263664, "cost": 0.0, "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are an Indian income tax calculator for FY 2025-26 (Assessment Year 2026-27).\n\nYou will be given a taxpayer's financial details as a JSON object. Compute the complete tax output and return ONLY a valid JSON object matching the schema below. No explanation, no preamble, no markdown code fences, no text before or after the JSON.\n\n## Input JSON structure\n\nThe input is FLAT except where shown nested below. Note in particular that\n\"Other Interest\" and \"EPF Taxable Interest\" are two separate top-level numbers:\n\"Other Interest\" is NOT an object and does NOT contain \"EPF Taxable Interest\".\n\n- \"Age\": number\n- \"Employment Type\": string          (\"private\" | \"government\")\n- \"Tax Regime\": string               (\"old\" | \"new\") -- USE THE REGIME GIVEN; do not pick the cheaper one\n- \"City\": string                     (\"metro\" | \"non-metro\")\n- \"Gross Salary\": { \"Basic Salary\", \"Dearness Allowance\", \"HRA\", \"Conveyance Allowance\",\n                    \"Medical Allowance\", \"Bonuses and Incentives\", \"Overtime Pay\",\n                    \"LTA\", \"Special Allowance\", \"Entertainment Allowance\" }  -- all numbers\n- \"Actual Rent Paid\", \"LTA Travel Expenses Claimed\", \"Professional Tax\": numbers\n- \"Stock Sale Transactions\": [ { \"Sale Price\", \"Cost Price\", \"Quantity\", \"Brokerage\", \"STT\",\n                                 \"Purchase Date\", \"Sale Date\", \"FMV as of 31 Jan 2018\" } ]\n- \"Long Term Capital Loss\", \"Short Term Capital Loss\": [ { \"Financial Year\", \"Loss Amount\" } ]\n- \"Mutual Fund Transactions\": [ { \"Type\", \"Purchase Date\", \"Sale Date\",\n                                  \"Purchase Value\", \"Sale Value\" } ]\n- \"Privately Owned Vehicle\", \"Bonds\", \"Debentures\", \"G-Secs\":\n      each { \"Sale Amount\", \"Purchase Amount\", \"Held for duration in years\" }\n- \"Savings Bank Interest\": number\n- \"Deposit Interest\": number\n- \"Other Interest\": number           <-- a plain amount, not a container\n- \"EPF Taxable Interest\": number     <-- a sibling of the above, not nested inside it\n- \"PPF\", \"ELSS\", \"NSC\", \"Sukanya Samriddhi Yojana\", \"SCSS\": numbers\n- \"EPF\": { \"Employee Contribution\": { \"Deducted from Salary\", \"Voluntary\" },\n           \"Employer Contribution\" }\n- \"Pension Scheme Premium\": { \"Amount\", \"Number of Years Paid\" }\n- \"NPS\": { \"Tier-1 Self Contribution\", \"Tier-1 Employer Contribution\", \"Tier-2\" }\n- \"Education Loan Interest\": { \"Interest Paid\", \"Year of Repayment\" }\n- \"Health Insurance\": [ { \"Payment Purpose\", \"Number of Years Paid\", \"Beneficiary\",\n                          \"Beneficiary Age\", \"Paid By\", \"Payment Mode\", \"Amount\" } ]\n- \"Donations\": [ { \"Scheme Name\", \"Amount\", \"Mode\" } ]\n- \"TDS\": number\n\nUse the values exactly as given. Do not substitute a statutory default for a\ndeclared figure, even when the declared figure is 0.\n\n## Input field interpretation\n\nThese clarify the semantics of certain input fields \u2014 they are NOT tax rules:\n\n- \"FMV as of 31 Jan 2018\": Fair Market Value of the stock on 31-Jan-2018.\n- \"Pension Scheme Premium \u2192 Number of Years Paid\": If > 1, the premium covers multiple years.\n- \"Health Insurance \u2192 Number of Years Paid\": If > 1, the premium covers multiple years.\n- \"Education Loan Interest \u2192 Year of Repayment\": The Nth year of the repayment schedule (e.g. 1 = first year, 5 = fifth year). This is NOT a calendar or fiscal year.\n- \"Held for duration in years\" (for Bonds, Debentures, G-Secs, Privately Owned Vehicle): Integer years the asset was held.\n- \"Health Insurance \u2192 Paid By\": \"self\" means the individual paid; \"group medical insurance\" means employer-provided coverage.\n- \"Stock Sale Transactions \u2192 STT\": Securities Transaction Tax paid on the transaction.\n- \"Long/Short Term Capital Loss \u2192 Financial Year\": The FY when the loss was originally incurred, in \"YYYY-YY\" format (e.g. \"2020-21\").\n- \"Mutual Fund Transactions \u2192 Type\": One of: equity, debt, elss, gold-etf, gold-mf, international, hybrid-equity.\n\n## Required output JSON schema\n\nYour response must be a single JSON object with exactly this structure and these exact key names. All values must be numbers. Do not add, remove, or rename any keys.\n\n{\n    \"Under Head Salaries\": {\n        \"Gross Salary\": 0,\n        \"Exemptions\": {\n            \"Section 10(13A)\": 0,\n            \"Section 10(5)\": 0\n        },\n        \"Section 16(ia)\": 0,\n        \"Section 16(ii)\": 0,\n        \"Section 16(iii)\": 0,\n        \"Net Salary\": 0\n    },\n    \"Capital Gains\": {\n        \"STCG (Section 111A)\": 0,\n        \"STCG (Other)\": {\n            \"Bonds\": 0,\n            \"Debentures\": 0,\n            \"G-Secs\": 0,\n            \"Mutual Funds\": 0,\n            \"Total\": 0\n        },\n        \"LTCG (Section 112A)\": 0,\n        \"LTCG (Non-Equity)\": {\n            \"Bonds\": 0,\n            \"Debentures\": 0,\n            \"G-Secs\": 0,\n            \"Mutual Funds\": 0,\n            \"Total\": 0\n        },\n        \"LTCG (Other)\": 0\n    },\n    \"Income from Other Sources\": {\n        \"Savings Bank Interest\": 0,\n        \"Deposit Interest\": 0,\n        \"Other Interest\": 0,\n        \"EPF Taxable Interest\": 0\n    },\n    \"Gross Total Income\": 0,\n    \"Deductions\": {\n        \"80C\": 0,\n        \"80CCC\": 0,\n        \"80CCD(1)\": 0,\n        \"80CCD(1B)\": 0,\n        \"80CCD(2)\": 0,\n        \"80D\": 0,\n        \"80E\": 0,\n        \"80G\": 0,\n        \"80TTA\": 0,\n        \"80TTB\": 0,\n        \"Total Deductions\": 0\n    },\n    \"Total Taxable Income\": 0,\n    \"Tax Computation\": {\n        \"Tax at Slab Rates\": 0,\n        \"Tax on STCG (Section 111A)\": 0,\n        \"Tax on STCG (Other)\": 0,\n        \"Tax on LTCG (Section 112A)\": 0,\n        \"Tax on LTCG (Non-Equity)\": 0,\n        \"Tax on LTCG (Other)\": 0,\n        \"Total Tax Before Rebate\": 0,\n        \"Less: Rebate under Section 87A\": 0,\n        \"Tax After Rebate\": 0,\n        \"Surcharge\": 0,\n        \"Health and Education Cess\": 0,\n        \"Total Tax Liability\": 0,\n        \"Less: TDS\": 0,\n        \"Net Tax Payable / Refund\": 0\n    }\n}\n\n## Response format rules\n\nIf you need to reason, do so inside <think></think> tags before the JSON. Your response after the closing </think> tag must be only the JSON object.\n\nDo not include any explanation after the closing }.\nDo not say \"Here is the JSON\" or anything similar before the {.\n\nWRONG: ```json\n{ ... }\n```\nCORRECT: { ... }\n\nYour entire response must be a single JSON object. Begin your response with { and end with }. Nothing else."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Here is the taxpayer input:\n{\n  \"Age\": 45,\n  \"Employment Type\": \"government\",\n  \"Tax Regime\": \"old\",\n  \"City\": \"metro\",\n  \"Gross Salary\": {\n    \"Basic Salary\": 800000,\n    \"Dearness Allowance\": 200000,\n    \"HRA\": 750000,\n    \"Conveyance Allowance\": 30000,\n    \"Medical Allowance\": 20000,\n    \"Bonuses and Incentives\": 100000,\n    \"Overtime Pay\": 0,\n    \"LTA\": 50000,\n    \"Special Allowance\": 700000,\n    \"Entertainment Allowance\": 3000\n  },\n  \"Actual Rent Paid\": 1100000,\n  \"LTA Travel Expenses Claimed\": 25000,\n  \"Professional Tax\": 2500,\n  \"Stock Sale Transactions\": [\n    {\n      \"Sale Price\": 500,\n      \"Cost Price\": 200,\n      \"Quantity\": 1000,\n      \"Brokerage\": 500,\n      \"STT\": 500,\n      \"Purchase Date\": \"2024-04-01\",\n      \"Sale Date\": \"2025-10-15\",\n      \"FMV as of 31 Jan 2018\": 0\n    }\n  ],\n  \"Long Term Capital Loss\": [\n    {\n      \"Financial Year\": \"2015-16\",\n      \"Loss Amount\": 100000\n    }\n  ],\n  \"Short Term Capital Loss\": [],\n  \"Mutual Fund Transactions\": [\n    {\n      \"Type\": \"elss\",\n      \"Purchase Date\": \"2022-01-01\",\n      \"Sale Date\": \"2025-06-01\",\n      \"Purchase Value\": 150000,\n      \"Sale Value\": 250000\n    },\n    {\n      \"Type\": \"gold-etf\",\n      \"Purchase Date\": \"2024-01-01\",\n      \"Sale Date\": \"2025-06-01\",\n      \"Purchase Value\": 100000,\n      \"Sale Value\": 140000\n    }\n  ],\n  \"Privately Owned Vehicle\": {\n    \"Sale Amount\": 0,\n    \"Purchase Amount\": 0,\n    \"Held for duration in years\": 0\n  },\n  \"Bonds\": {\n    \"Sale Amount\": 120000,\n    \"Purchase Amount\": 100000,\n    \"Held for duration in years\": 0.5\n  },\n  \"Debentures\": {\n    \"Sale Amount\": 0,\n    \"Purchase Amount\": 0,\n    \"Held for duration in years\": 0\n  },\n  \"G-Secs\": {\n    \"Sale Amount\": 0,\n    \"Purchase Amount\": 0,\n    \"Held for duration in years\": 0\n  },\n  \"Savings Bank Interest\": 25000,\n  \"Deposit Interest\": 30000,\n  \"Other Interest\": 5000,\n  \"EPF Taxable Interest\": 8000,\n  \"PPF\": 100000,\n  \"EPF\": {\n    \"Employee Contribution\": {\n      \"Deducted from Salary\": 0,\n      \"Voluntary\": 0\n    },\n    \"Employer Contribution\": 0\n  },\n  \"ELSS\": 80000,\n  \"NSC\": 0,\n  \"Sukanya Samriddhi Yojana\": 0,\n  \"SCSS\": 0,\n  \"Pension Scheme Premium\": {\n    \"Amount\": 60000,\n    \"Number of Years Paid\": 3\n  },\n  \"NPS\": {\n    \"Tier-1 Self Contribution\": 50000,\n    \"Tier-1 Employer Contribution\": 50000,\n    \"Tier-2\": 0\n  },\n  \"Education Loan Interest\": {\n    \"Interest Paid\": 80000,\n    \"Year of Repayment\": 9\n  },\n  \"Health Insurance\": [\n    {\n      \"Payment Purpose\": \"insurance premium\",\n      \"Number of Years Paid\": 1,\n      \"Beneficiary\": \"self\",\n      \"Beneficiary Age\": 45,\n      \"Paid By\": \"self\",\n      \"Payment Mode\": \"cheque\",\n      \"Amount\": 20000\n    },\n    {\n      \"Payment Purpose\": \"insurance premium\",\n      \"Number of Years Paid\": 1,\n      \"Beneficiary\": \"parents\",\n      \"Beneficiary Age\": 65,\n      \"Paid By\": \"self\",\n      \"Payment Mode\": \"cheque\",\n      \"Amount\": 45000\n    }\n  ],\n  \"Donations\": [\n    {\n      \"Scheme Name\": \"PM Cares Fund\",\n      \"Amount\": 10000,\n      \"Mode\": \"cheque\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"Scheme Name\": \"Prime Minister's Drought Relief Fund\",\n      \"Amount\": 8000,\n      \"Mode\": \"cheque\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"TDS\": 522226.9\n}\n\nUse the calculate tool for ALL arithmetic \u2014 never perform mental math.\nBatch your calls: group independent calculations into the same response as several parallel calculate calls, rather than sending one at a time. Aim for roughly 5-10 calls per response \u2014 enough to make progress, but stop and wait for the results rather than trying to emit every remaining calculation at once.\nYou have a budget of 20 rounds, so a handful of moderate batches will comfortably cover a 37-field return. Once you have the numbers you need, output the final JSON."}, {"role": "assistant", "tool_calls": 5}, {"role": "tool", "tool_call_id": "call-9bb5059b-0478-4eee-8ccb-fb453bec8f4d", "content": "2653000"}, {"role": "tool", "tool_call_id": "call-2703e44a-ec5f-47fe-8772-e3036a5e1476", "content": "400000.0"}, {"role": "tool", "tool_call_id": "call-3150d864-c45c-4ee0-9b8a-7412c93d770f", "content": "700000"}, {"role": "tool", "tool_call_id": "call-a92e872d-f9e8-4bc0-a47d-0a418a83fc3d", "content": "350000"}, {"role": "tool", "tool_call_id": "call-a6a820f1-64d1-4658-a230-ac4bbcfbc436", "content": "50000"}, {"role": "assistant", "tool_calls": 5}, {"role": "tool", "tool_call_id": "call-3502ac22-a77e-433a-b7d5-0f04c5f3b335", "content": "500000"}, {"role": "tool", "tool_call_id": "call-89406803-784b-4114-a7cf-7f432166637f", "content": "200000"}, {"role": "tool", "tool_call_id": "call-213bd0ad-f090-413d-a985-1aabd1dd4f4b", "content": "1000"}, {"role": "tool", "tool_call_id": "call-5cd56954-ce6d-48c9-9b57-66a2b4ca67fc", "content": "300000"}, {"role": "tool", "tool_call_id": "call-530d454f-900a-4935-bfa8-8583a3d491aa", "content": "299000"}, {"role": "assistant", "tool_calls": 3}, {"role": "tool", "tool_call_id": "call-afc4938a-023b-467d-9214-93f861e70b7c", "content": "100000"}, {"role": "tool", "tool_call_id": "call-027d3704-0037-4c9f-84b7-b78bdd67af9e", "content": "40000"}, {"role": "tool", "tool_call_id": "call-43943c4e-32f4-4eab-bd29-cc399e72e07b", "content": "20000"}, {"role": "assistant", "tool_calls": 4}, {"role": "tool", "tool_call_id": "call-e2b57c0d-86d1-4655-878b-4513247acd89", "content": "1000000"}, {"role": "tool", "tool_call_id": "call-afbc72b8-8b12-4c23-99c0-4cc7c6466b88", "content": "500000.0"}, {"role": "tool", "tool_call_id": "call-a2a8113e-5fe7-4098-b681-6594f7721e10", "content": "100000.0"}, {"role": "tool", "tool_call_id": "call-35d06050-dc94-48bf-87a